# ── Build artifacts and scratch files ──
# A 1.1MB compiled Vite bundle (index.js) and a stray Home_Overwritten.tsx were
# committed to the repo root, alongside ~40 one-off .cjs/.py scripts left over
# from earlier patch work. They were unreferenced by any config and made the
# project look unfinished to anyone opening it. These patterns stop that
# recurring; put throwaway scripts in scripts/ or outside the repo.
index.js
bundle.js
*_Overwritten.tsx
*.patch
server_out.txt
_probe*.ts
_tmp*
script-grep*.cjs
strip_*.cjs
revert_*.cjs

# Database snapshots from `npm run backup`. These contain student personal data
# — names, emails, schools, and base64 resume/passport uploads for people who
# are mostly minors. Never commit one.
backups/
